      "content": "Wait, what are you doing with the \"mischievous elf\" and \"invisible creature\" stuff? This is supposed to be a professional HR memo for a software company, not a fantasy novel. \n\nCould you please rewrite those paragraphs? I need them to be strictly clinical and medical in tone—no mentions of elves, creatures, or invisible hands. Just focus on the actual physiological sensations like paresthesia or muscular tension. And can you finish point 4 for me as well?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
